    • Society
                          众


       The increase of population will cause food shortage, aﬀect the balance of food sup-
                                                Hm
       ply and demand, and cause the uneven distribution and waste of food resources.
       Agricultural output determines the eating habits of the region, and people of dif-
                   公



       ferent ages also have diﬀerent eating habits. In turn, eating habits will determine
