  3.2    Optimization for Equity and Sustainability




                                                        学
     We extract four important factors as they run through nearly all of the Equity. These
  four indicator are: Race, Food Safety, Gender and Policy. Besides, we extract another




                                                      数
  ﬁve superior indicator when it comes to Sustainability. (Willett, W.,2019). These are:
  Climate Change, Freshwater Use, Nitrogen and Phosphorus Flows, Biodiversity Loss and
  Land-system Change.                              ：

                                                  els
     We will explore the mechanism of inﬂuence between these inferior indicators that aﬀect
  Equity, Sustainability and the Food System, and at this time we will consider optimizing
                           号
  the original basic model to Equity and Sustainability factors. Therefore, we can give the



                                                od
  optimization index after the inﬂuence:
                          众


                                       VC = vi × i + εi                                          (19)
                                              Hm
      where Vc is the indicator after the optimization of Equity and Sustainability; vi is the
